Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.98,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\c&H23363B&\3c&H4A7093&\shad0\b1}Tokyo Metropolitan\NJujutsu Technical High School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:09.44,Main,MachineBlue,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&HBD5350&\bord3\shad0\c&HFFDAD2&\frx352\fry330\pos(388.667,158)\frz343.1}Cold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:15.40,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Couldn't they put in a few \Nmore vending machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:19.46,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They can't. There are only so many \Nworkers who can come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:20.67,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:22.84,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Where are the first-years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.55,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,On errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.92,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.61,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Will they be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:28.29,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:30.66,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,They're not three years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.31,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,They can handle an errand run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:34.39,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.86,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It's today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.81,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,The day Kyoto's principal comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.60,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,To go over the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.48,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:46.56,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Satoru's fighting with the higher-ups \Nbecause they arranged for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:50.03,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,the first-years to get dispatched \Non that special-grade case, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.55,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,And the principal of Kyoto is \None of those higher-ups, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.80,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,So if they run into each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:01.88,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,The first-year they were \Ntargeting, Itadori, is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:05.46,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt he has any plans to do \Nanything about the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:12.29,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, the old man from Kyoto \Nwon't cause a scene in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:13.52,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.85,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,An instructor might have \Nhis position to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.96,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,but that's not the case for the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.92,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you saying Mai is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:23.90,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:26.49,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Students aren't necessary for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.86,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:33.66,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,They love harassing us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.94,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Both Toudou and Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:39.71,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here, Zenin-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:40.99,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:44.16,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,They do seem similar. Are they sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.59,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:48.00,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me that, Fushiguro-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.72,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,You make me sound the same as Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.59,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Call me Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:57.22,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,So these are the pinch hitters \Nfor Okkotsu and the third-years?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:00.89,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,We came here with the principal \Nbecause we were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:03.32,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Your classmate died, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:04.57,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Was that rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:06.72,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Or did you think nothing of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.62,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:11.65,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:13.81,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Some things are hard to say out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.79,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll say it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.48,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,"Vessel" makes it sound nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:21.20,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,but it just means he was a half-curse monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:25.24,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Having such a tainted, \Ninhuman being beside you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:30.00,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,brazenly calling himself a jujutsu \Nsorcerer must have been revolting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:33.19,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you feeling better \Nnow that he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:39.63,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Mai, don't bring up such pointless topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:45.60,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only here to see if these guys \Nare fit to take Okkotsu's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.62,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:52.49,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.61,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of woman is your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.96,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Depending on your answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.57,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll beat you half to death right here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:09.04,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,and drag Okkotsu, or at least the \Nthird-years, out to the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:17.68,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, my type is a \Ntall woman with a big ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:35.98,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(1191,431)\t(1192,1316,1 \c&H0700D7&\3c&H6659E4&)\t(1317,1941,1 \c&H172918&\3c&H8CCECB&)\t(6197,6529,1 \c&H0F0063&\3c&H222781&)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:58.86,Ep_Title_Shadow,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,562)\fs20\pos(612,310)}Episode 8:  {\fs24}Boredom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:58.86,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,562)\fs20\pos(612,310)}Episode 8:  {\fs24}Boredom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:54.79,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Why do I have to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.57,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}my taste in women with a guy I just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.72,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,He's right. That's a tall hurdle \Nfor an antisocial guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:03.61,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:06.98,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This is confusing enough already.\NYou'll just make it more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:10.24,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoto, third-year, Toudou Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:12.26,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Introduction over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.56,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.01,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and answer. \NIf you prefer men, that's fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:21.81,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,A person's fetishes reflect \Neverything about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:25.82,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,People with boring taste in women \Nare boring people themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.58,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,And I hate boring men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:36.55,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,The exchange event is where my soul can \Nbe free as blood boils and flesh clashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:43.38,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows what I might do if my \Nlast exchange event ends up boring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.49,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, aren't the Jujutsu Tech \Nschools four-year schools?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:49.09,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Only third-years and under \Ncan join the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.27,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:54.88,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,As a show of kindness, I'll let you \Noff only half-dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.34,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Answer me, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.35,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of woman is your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.12,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Is this some kind of comedy routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:02.74,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is that your summer uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:05.69,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Ticks me off, but it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.69,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki's unarmed.\NI'd rather avoid confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:14.53,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,Not forgiving people isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.20,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,That's just part of your kindness, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:22.53,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a particular preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:28.06,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she has unshakable \Ncharacter, I won't ask for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:32.48,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bad answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:35.41,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,If you had said something like \N"big boobs," I'd have killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:37.01,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:40.42,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:45.84,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You're boring, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.88,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Poor Fushiguro-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:03.96,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Even a talented \Nsecond-grade jujutsu sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:08.27,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,is nothing more than a first-year \Nagainst the top-grade Toudou-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.44,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to comfort him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:15.04,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you two were similar, \Nbut that's not the case at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Maki-san's a hundred times prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.30,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not sleeping enough? \NYou've got open pores.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.97,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.65,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,how to speak to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:36.10,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I knew at first glance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.49,0:07:38.97,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,that you were a boring guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:43.02,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,But you shouldn't judge a \Nperson by their looks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:46.25,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,So I went out of my way to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:51.09,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,but you just trampled on my kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:54.95,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Is your brain as pineapple as your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:59.72,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Toudou... {\i0}That{\i1} Toudou?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.16,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The one involved in last year's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:05.20,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,unprecedented jujutsu terror attack\Ncaused by the curse user, Getou—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.96,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(439,434)\pos(315,50)\an8\fs16\fnArial\b1\c&H4253EF&\3c&HF0F1FA&\shad0}Kabuki-cho First Street
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.61,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The Night Parade of a Hundred Demons \Nfrom Kyoto to Shinjuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:11.68,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The one who exorcised a special-grade and five first-grade cursed spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:14.77,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,by himself when the parade appeared in Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:16.96,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That Toudou?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.89,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Still, there are several first-grade \Nsorcerers capable of beating a special-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:22.81,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What's shocking is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:26.12,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you don't use cursed techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:29.73,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, that rumor's false.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:32.26,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I used them against the special-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:34.48,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't use them against first-grades?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:35.55,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Is he a monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:37.62,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's a relief to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:42.75,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Nue, plus Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:48.28,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Bottomless Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.80,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm up against a hardcore \Nclose-range fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.65,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep my distance and restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:03.52,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.31,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't his full speed earlier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.81,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Flimsy and shallow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.74,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Both your body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:13.59,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,and your taste in women!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:27.47,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:29.29,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,His power is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.48,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not finished yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:53.82,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You're always
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.02,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,so boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:09.75,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I barely feel any intention to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:13.19,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I've been holding back, and you're so proud?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:15.04,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to insist like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:19.73,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,then I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:24.00,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.48,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:32.88,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,What are you two doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:38.01,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Whew, just barely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.76,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.91,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I guess that might actually be an out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.67,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Long time no see, Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:51.99,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't you just wait \Nuntil the exchange event?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:56.48,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Go on home, or I'll start screaming, "No!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.67,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to tell me to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.95,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd I put my jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:06.89,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I won't be bored the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:13.31,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Give Okkotsu a message for me: \N"You take part, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:15.20,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.26,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I panda. I no understand human speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:19.56,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:29.79,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to continue as a jujutsu sorcerer, \Nlearn to choose who you pick a fight with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:37.32,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing to our errand runner, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:41.92,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my. You're such a loser, \NI didn't even notice you, Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.72,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We're both equally losers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.80,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,All you can do is imbue objects \Nwith cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.95,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,and you've got shit for cursed techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:52.06,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Better than having no cursed energy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.76,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,My neck gets sore looking up \Nat others all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:57.02,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,so I need to look down on someone \Nlike you every so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:01.24,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, forget it. We're both at \Nrock bottom, and it's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.62,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara, can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:04.88,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:06.77,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,She won't be getting up for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:08.53,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I hurt her pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:12.17,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,What? You want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.02,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Nice support, Maki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:22.42,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You put a bunch of holes \Nin my brand new tracksuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:26.42,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Leave that uniform of yours behind.\NI'll make it my own summer uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.99,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll put holes in your body next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.39,0:12:34.25,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, you wouldn't be able to wear \Nthis with those long legs of yours—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.11,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.37,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,We're leaving, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:44.46,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,What?! No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.23,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there's my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:48.30,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Fushiguro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.13,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. The others are with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.42,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.64,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Quit joking! I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:58.64,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:02.38,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Unlike you, I still have \Nimportant business here in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:07.90,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}My personal handshake with Takada-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.80,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,305)\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\3c&H180591&\shad0\pos(423.332,212.667)\frz273.7}5 min
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.80,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,305)\fs10\shad0\bord3\fscx80\fnTimes New Roman\c&H120490&\3c&HEBECEC&\frz273.4\frx348\fry4\pos(415.334,306)}8th single "Youth Mineral" Release Celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.80,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,305)\c&H54585A&\3c&HEDEFF6&\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs18\frz274.2\frx354\fry6\pos(392,275.334)}Takada-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.85,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(860,1)\pos(340,190)\fnArial\b1\c&H9C1CDF&\4c&HFEFEFF&\shad2\bord1}Tall Idol Takada-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.86,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:21.22,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows what I might do if I miss my \Ntransfer and can't make it to the event hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.26,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:26.80,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh! You're so selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.97,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Can't believe I lost the lottery \Nfor the usual one in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:34.96,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go thinking you'll get off \Nthis easy at the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:37.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Quit acting like you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:39.56,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Leave your uniform behind, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.17,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:43.92,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Winning or losing here hardly matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.96,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We'll beat them up at the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.93,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Maki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:52.32,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is what she said true? \NThat you don't have cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.16,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:58.86,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So I can't even see curses \Nwithout these glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.73,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I use cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:03.94,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,They already have curses imbued in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:08.69,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't pour my own cursed energy \Ninto them to do things like you all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.69,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Like that thing he gave Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.69,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Then why are you a jujutsu sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.56,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,To spite them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:25.50,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait to see the looks on my family's faces when I become a bigshot sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:29.43,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,after all the years they've \Nspent looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:33.93,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's hurry over to see Shouko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:40.24,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I respect you, Maki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.69,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.98,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:53.99,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.17,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Is Yaga here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:11.68,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,The time of an old man close \Nto death doesn't come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:17.92,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Principal Yaga won't be coming for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:20.58,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:26.56,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,He was given a false schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.63,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,After some threats to Ijichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:32.94,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the other day, \NPrincipal Gakuganji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:36.14,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? What other day would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.08,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play dumb with me, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.32,0:15:40.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm referring to the case with Itadori Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:43.45,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,As head of the conservatives, \Nyou were involved too, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:49.52,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness, youth these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:51.71,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know how to be polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.77,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I never had any intention of respecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:58.43,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Elders these days love to act important, \Nand it's so annoying, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:15:59.59,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:02.60,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Your conduct is problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.87,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be reporting you to \Nthe relevant authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.17,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:11.12,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,It's Gojou Satoru in person! \NGojou Satoru in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.50,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Feel free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.01,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I don't plan to chat for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.88,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,He spoke! He spoke to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:26.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, I was attacked by two \Nunregistered special-grade cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:29.57,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:31.77,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get me wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:35.78,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,To me, it was about like being coerced \Ninto taking a survey in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.03,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:43.63,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,The two cursed spirits were \Ncapable of communication,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:46.28,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,and they probably have \Nallies who are just as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.81,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's not just our enemies, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:53.69,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Hakari, Okkotsu, and your Toudou...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:57.71,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,The level of our students has risen \Ndrastically in recent years, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:02.61,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Then there was last year's \Nincident with Getou Suguru...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:09.60,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,And now, the appearance of Sukuna's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.44,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.34,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:17.89,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,The wave of power you guys \Nhave been trying to hold back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:20.06,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,with your pointless status and traditions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:23.36,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,has grown bigger than you can handle \Nand is now descending upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.73,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be able to measure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.32,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,the coming age with the \Nclassification of "special-grade."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:31.92,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,If you think I'm the only \None who'll be fighting back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.56,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,you're going to get hurt, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:39.83,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,I think you are getting a bit out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.83,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.32,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's all I wanted to say. \NI'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.35,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Principal Yaga will be \Ncoming in about two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:54.71,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.33,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Two hours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:04.17,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,Miwa, would you go buy me some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:04.73,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.84,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:18.32,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,If I can catch up to him, I'll get \Nhim to take a picture with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:21.32,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H6A6B69&\3c&HEEF0EC&\frx0\fry338\frz5.944\pos(410.667,241.334)}Takada-chan Personal Handshake Event
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.57,0:18:26.14,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a Taka-tan Beam, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.91,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:32.12,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Tan, Taka-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:37.74,Main,Staff,0000,0000,0000,,Time's up.
