Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:33.22,Main,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:37.37,Main,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.16,Main,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,In the theater?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:48.66,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. You can see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.18,Main,Nanami,0000,0000,0000,,It's a gruesome sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.23,0:20:07.78,Main,Nanami,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready to witness it, Itadori-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.96,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:55.66,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:58.42,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I got a photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:13.07,Main,Gakuganji,0000,0000,0000,,My tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:14.38,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.52,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Screen&Three,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:19.02,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(366,93)\fs16\b1\fnArial\c&H292929&\bord0\shad0\fay.05}Personal Handshake Event
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:19.02,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\b1\fnArial\c&HB16225&\bord0\shad0\fay.04\pos(370,238)}Event Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:23.90,Main,Fan,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that hot lady is looking \Nat us like we're garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:25.30,Main,Fan,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:27.33,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Mai, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.33,0:22:28.08,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.94,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Did something unpleasant happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.03,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you ask yourself that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:34.32,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,So this moment has finally come...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:35.05,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.54,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(605,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\3c&H180591&\shad0\frz52.58\pos(145.998,309.334)}5 min
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.54,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(605,1)\fs10\shad0\bord3\fscx89\fnTimes New Roman\c&H120490&\3c&HEBECEC&\frx348\fry4\pos(219.334,240.667)\frz46.45}8th single "Youth Mineral" Release Celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.54,Main,Ticket,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(605,1)\c&H54585A&\3c&HEDEFF6&\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs18\frx354\fry6\frz48.49\pos(210.666,282)}Takada-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:36.54,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:38.56,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,For the next handshake event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:41.92,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You should go experience how \Nwonderful Takada-chan is in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:43.84,Italics,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just plain annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:47.76,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,This is my duty as a fan... \NAs a future husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.52,Italics,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,That's just plain creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:53.82,Italics,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,But if I reject his offer, \Nhe'll get even more annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:54.93,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.88,0:23:01.44,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:03.64,Main,Staff,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:07.04,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:08.88,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,It's your first time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:09.95,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.83,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:12.76,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:15.85,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Mai-chan, are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:17.62,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.22,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,It was more the people than the line...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:23.49,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,Then come back again \Nwhen you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.89,0:23:26.47,Main,Takada,0000,0000,0000,,I'll remember you, Mai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.35,0:23:28.77,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You're back, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:30.41,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:31.97,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:37.84,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,True, Takada-chan isn't a woman \Nthat can so easily be put into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.32,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,She's not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:54.99,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1027,1)}Episode 9:\NSmall Fry and Reverse Retribution
